OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FStuart and Amy offer a great big
OL,7,     Fslice of vintage Americana at the
OL,8,     FTin Can Retreat in Ceredigion. But
OL,9,     Fcould cleanliness complaints
OL,10,     Fderail their bid for victory?
OL,11,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FFor the week's final visit, the
OL,13,     FB&Bers head to Steve and Mandy's
OL,14,     Fclassic country pub, The
OL,15,     FThorverton Arms in Devon, where a
OL,16,     Fbelly-busting breakfast could
OL,17,     Fprove their saviour.
